What Are Lithium Supplement Additives?
Lithium supplement additives represent a breakthrough class of materials designed to enhance lithium-ion battery performance through pre-lithiation techniques. These specialized compounds including lithium-rich variants like Li5FeO4 (LFO) and Li2NiO2 (LNO)—compensate for lithium loss during initial charge cycles, dramatically improving first-cycle efficiency and extending battery lifespan.

